}`

`user_proxy = UserProxyAgent(
    name="user_proxy",
    system_message="A human that will provide the necessary information to the assistant",
    function_map={
        "write_to_file": write_to_file,
        "read_from_file": read_from_file,
        "read_pdf": read_pdf,
        "create_directory": create_directory,
    },
    code_execution_config={"work_dir": "fileread"})`

`assistant = AssistantAgent(
    name="assistant",
    system_message="""You are an assistant, you must blah blah""",
    llm_config=llm_config
)`

When initiating this, it works flawlessly. Functions are used properly.

But if I add another llm and a group chat

`architect = AssistantAgent(
    name="architect",
    system_message="""You are a blah blah, and will get info from assistant etc etc""",
